WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:01.650
- Everybody, I'm hanging Penn &amp; Teller!

00:00:01.650 --> 00:00:03.330
Give it up! (clapping)

00:00:03.330 --> 00:00:06.230
All right, so with what do you
guys have to show us today?

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:11.090
You look so crazy, man.
(Penn laughing)

00:00:11.090 --> 00:00:11.923
I love you.

00:00:11.923 --> 00:00:14.770
- Sometimes X equals X.
- [Kelly] Yeah. (laughs)

00:00:14.770 --> 00:00:17.580
- I'm gonna take three
of these grapefruit,

00:00:17.580 --> 00:00:21.440
and we've written names of
some of your songs on here.

00:00:21.440 --> 00:00:24.167
Now, we've got "Stronger",
"Piece By Piece",

00:00:24.167 --> 00:00:25.520
"A Moment Like This,"

00:00:25.520 --> 00:00:27.150
You wanna change any one of these

00:00:27.150 --> 00:00:28.810
for any one of those there?

00:00:28.810 --> 00:00:30.290
I want you to have a free
choice of grapefruit.

00:00:30.290 --> 00:00:31.500
- No! I like dealer's choice.

00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:32.910
Let's pick the ones you did!

00:00:32.910 --> 00:00:34.011
- [Penn] So you want
me to take these three?

00:00:34.011 --> 00:00:35.200
- [Kelly] Yeah!
- With these three?

00:00:35.200 --> 00:00:36.880
Now I'm gonna have you,

00:00:36.880 --> 00:00:37.713
- [Kelly] Those are heavy, too!

00:00:37.713 --> 00:00:39.920
I'm gonna ask you a few questions, there.

00:00:39.920 --> 00:00:42.650
I want you to name a
number between one and 10.

00:00:42.650 --> 00:00:44.760
Now, most people name seven.

00:00:44.760 --> 00:00:46.650
That's the number they name the most,

00:00:46.650 --> 00:00:48.460
but you can name any number you want.

00:00:48.460 --> 00:00:51.740
One, two, three, four, five,
six, seven, eight, nine, or 10?

00:00:51.740 --> 00:00:52.573
What would you like?

00:00:52.573 --> 00:00:53.406
- Four.
- [Penn] Four.

00:00:53.406 --> 00:00:54.640
Wanna change your mind?
- Nope.

00:00:54.640 --> 00:00:55.530
- [Penn] Sure?
- Yep, very sure.

00:00:55.530 --> 00:00:57.540
- Okay, want black or red?

00:00:57.540 --> 00:00:59.010
- What!?
- [Penn] Black or red?

00:00:59.010 --> 00:00:59.890
- Oh, red.

00:00:59.890 --> 00:01:01.640
- [Penn] Red. Okay, you
wanna change your mind?

00:01:01.640 --> 00:01:02.576
- No.

00:01:02.576 --> 00:01:03.810
- You want diamonds or hearts?

00:01:03.810 --> 00:01:05.440
- Diamonds! April, hello.

00:01:05.440 --> 00:01:06.400
- [Penn] Diamonds?
- Yes.

00:01:06.400 --> 00:01:07.577
- Wanna change your mind?
- [Kelly] No.

00:01:07.577 --> 00:01:09.570
- Did you say the four of diamonds?

00:01:09.570 --> 00:01:10.403
- [Kelly] Four of diamonds.

00:01:10.403 --> 00:01:11.920
- [Penn] Four of diamonds
is what you've chose.

00:01:11.920 --> 00:01:13.330
You wanna change your mind?
- [Kelly] No!

00:01:13.330 --> 00:01:14.440
- You're gonna think back on this.

00:01:14.440 --> 00:01:15.310
You wanna change your mind?

00:01:15.310 --> 00:01:16.260
- No.
- [Penn] Okay.

00:01:16.260 --> 00:01:18.640
Now, I've got these three songs, here.

00:01:18.640 --> 00:01:20.957
Which one do you want,
there? Name one of them.

00:01:20.957 --> 00:01:22.170
- "Stronger"!

00:01:22.170 --> 00:01:23.920
- [Penn] Say "Stronger"? Okay.

00:01:23.920 --> 00:01:27.107
You ready, Teller? Here comes "Stronger".

00:01:28.007 --> 00:01:28.840
- [Kelly] (gasps) Okay.

00:01:28.840 --> 00:01:30.090
- [Penn] And we have two others, here.

00:01:30.090 --> 00:01:32.050
We got "Stronger" on the knife,

00:01:32.050 --> 00:01:36.500
we got "A Moment Like This,
and "Piece By Piece", here.

00:01:36.500 --> 00:01:38.870
Now, I want you to see this one, here.

00:01:38.870 --> 00:01:43.303
If we took this and cut it open like so,

00:01:44.450 --> 00:01:46.790
you would see, in the middle of that,

00:01:46.790 --> 00:01:50.700
you would see nothing but
citrus goodness, there.

00:01:50.700 --> 00:01:52.287
Now, if we took this one,

00:01:52.287 --> 00:01:54.650
"A Moment Like This",

00:01:54.650 --> 00:01:56.223
and cut this one open,

00:01:58.540 --> 00:02:02.540
you would see nothing in
there, but citrus goodness,

00:02:02.540 --> 00:02:06.220
but "Stronger", which
is the one you chose,

00:02:06.220 --> 00:02:07.220
- [Kelly] Oh my God,

00:02:08.855 --> 00:02:11.620
if the four diamonds is in there, get out.

00:02:11.620 --> 00:02:12.490
- [Penn] Could be.

00:02:12.490 --> 00:02:15.180
There is something in
there, no doubt about it.

00:02:15.180 --> 00:02:18.160
- If the fricking card is in it,

00:02:18.160 --> 00:02:19.210
- Let's see what the,

00:02:22.960 --> 00:02:24.280
- [Kelly] What?!

00:02:24.280 --> 00:02:26.650
- [Penn] Looks like the
fricking card is in there.

00:02:26.650 --> 00:02:28.710
- If that is the four of diamonds,

00:02:28.710 --> 00:02:31.170
you get the hell out, right now!

00:02:31.170 --> 00:02:33.480
- Let me just remember how we picked this.

00:02:33.480 --> 00:02:35.690
Now, you said four.

00:02:35.690 --> 00:02:38.060
I asked you, Kelly, to
change your mind, didn't I?

00:02:38.060 --> 00:02:40.150
- You did, and I am stubborn!

00:02:40.150 --> 00:02:41.000
I'm a Taurus.

00:02:41.000 --> 00:02:43.010
- [Penn] Then I said red, you said red,

00:02:43.010 --> 00:02:45.490
I said, "Change your mind."
You could have gone to black.

00:02:45.490 --> 00:02:47.150
I even told you, you know?

00:02:47.150 --> 00:02:48.083
And then I said,

00:02:48.941 --> 00:02:49.774
"Hearts or diamonds?"
- Oh my God,

00:02:49.774 --> 00:02:50.607
it's the four of diamonds, isn't it?

00:02:50.607 --> 00:02:54.020
And also, you picked
the grapefruit, right?

00:02:54.020 --> 00:02:55.650
Could have been any of these songs.

00:02:55.650 --> 00:02:57.180
You could have done "Walk Away",

00:02:57.180 --> 00:02:58.013
- [Kelly] No, I don't understand.

00:02:58.013 --> 00:02:59.140
- [Penn] But you didn't do any of that.

00:02:59.140 --> 00:02:59.973
- I don't understand.

00:02:59.973 --> 00:03:02.000
- [Penn] And here, in
this citrusy goodness,

00:03:02.000 --> 00:03:03.350
what was the card you said, again?

00:03:03.350 --> 00:03:05.210
- [Kelly] No way.

00:03:05.210 --> 00:03:06.156
- [Penn] Way!

00:03:06.156 --> 00:03:07.584
- [Kelly] What?!
- [Penn] Way.

00:03:07.584 --> 00:03:09.930
- I don't understand how you do that!

00:03:09.930 --> 00:03:12.150
- [Penn] There it is, right there.

00:03:12.150 --> 00:03:13.390
There it is, right there,

00:03:13.390 --> 00:03:17.000
and we can even keep our safe distance.

00:03:17.000 --> 00:03:19.140
- [Kelly] You guys, this is the real card.

00:03:19.140 --> 00:03:21.940
- [Penn] Yes, it has good citrusy smell.

00:03:21.940 --> 00:03:23.520
- [Kelly] I don't understand it.

00:03:23.520 --> 00:03:24.680
- [Penn] It's a trick!

00:03:24.680 --> 00:03:26.752
- It's such a good one!
- We were lying to you!

00:03:26.752 --> 00:03:28.387
- It is such a good one!
- Oh, thank you!

00:03:28.387 --> 00:03:31.690
- How in the world did
you know? That's amazing!

00:03:31.690 --> 00:03:33.480
- [Penn] You're just such
a four of diamonds gal!

00:03:33.480 --> 00:03:35.090
- [Kelly] I am such a fool!

00:03:35.090 --> 00:03:36.780
I didn't see what you did there,

00:03:36.780 --> 00:03:39.180
but oh my God, that was incredible.

00:03:39.180 --> 00:03:41.293
That's a fricking four of diamonds.

00:03:42.664 --> 00:03:46.340
What the hell just happened?
(audience cheering)

00:03:46.340 --> 00:03:49.372
Thank you guys so much! That was amazing.

00:03:49.372 --> 00:03:50.870
So, be sure to watch

00:03:50.870 --> 00:03:54.150
the "Fool Us" Christmas
special December 16th,

00:03:54.150 --> 00:03:56.720
I'm freaking out, and look
out for the new season

00:03:56.720 --> 00:03:58.353
starting January 8th on the CW.

